{
  "_doc": "Co-presence-first script, slow burn. Ep0 = intro (intro_node). Ep1-Ep14 reveal one-per-completed-focus via EPISODE_START_NODES (epNN_01). Each episode: Yua opens (a few beats) -> in-character player choices (reflective/topical, NEVER session-management) -> Yua's branched reply (a few beats) -> terminal (settle back to co-presence; player runs as many focus sessions as they like via the timer UI, Yua never 'ends' a session). Type input = a choice whose next is an AI_MODE_* id (flips Type Mode on, stores message to memory). {focus_minutes} in ep01_01 choice 1 is an ENGINE token: substitute with the just-completed focus length in minutes (fallback: strip it). Functional nodes (idle, TASK_INPUT_*, FOCUS_*, ABORT_*, return_*, greeting_*, EXIT_*) preserved. ENGINE: episodes are now flag-guarded (seen_flag + optional unlock.total_focus_seconds_min); see _pacing_doc. DEMO_SCRIPT_VERSION is 11 (Ep3 canon 2026-09-06: 脑子飞了 confession + platform question with chips/typed_routes/remember + P.S. answer; 「那个东西」→「我的小项目」; Ep0-Ep2 rewritten to 2026-08-17 canon: opening D 开局翻车 + 书咖 world; ACTION_GO_15/30/60 start focus immediately).",
  "fallback_id": "idle",
  "intro_node": "ep00_01",
  "demo_script_version": 11,
  "_pacing_doc": "Episodes are flag-guarded: each fires once when completed_focus_count >= session_gate AND its unlock is satisfied AND its seen_flag is not yet set (lowest unmet gate first). The matching epNN_01 node carries set_flags:[\"epNN_seen\"]. Casual chats are count-only; writing/relationship beats add unlock.total_focus_seconds_min so short (3s test) sessions can't speed-run intimacy — real 15-45min sessions clear these naturally. TUNE pacing here: raise/lower total_focus_seconds_min (in seconds) per beat. When no episode is eligible, the engine falls back to FOCUS_DONE_REPEAT.",
